  "summary": "A spray dryer turns a liquid feed into a dry powder in one step. The liquid is atomised into fine droplets by a fast-spinning wheel or nozzles inside a chamber of hot air; the water evaporates in seconds and the dry particles fall to the cone or are collected from the exhaust air by a cyclone.",
